<LVClass LVVersion="18008000">
	<Property Name="NI.Lib.Description" Type="Str">This class simulate the operation of an EMCCD camera. With this class, it is possible to do all the tasks allowed by a real camera, like to write the operation mode or acquire a series of images. These images are an array of zeros, though.</Property>
